#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffecteq10.rst:16 9f4b6f7b13ee44d6ba481ea4816b8a7d
msgid "10-band graphic equalizer audio effect."
msgstr "10 段均衡器预设。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffecteq10.rst:21 a3d9d1bb7f4245d9b5d9340b91b5348e
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffecteq10.rst:23 55db32837cc442d2a512f0c30d84b254
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectEQ10 is a 10-band graphic equalizer using FMOD's MULTIBAND_EQ DSP. It provides "
"frequency equalization across ten bands spanning from 31Hz to 16000Hz, suitable for detailed "
"audio shaping."
msgstr ""
"**FmodAudioEffectEQ10**    是    ``FmodAudioEffectEQ``    的 10 频段预设版本。默认频段为    ``31.25``   、   "
"``62.5``   、   ``125``   、   ``250``   、   ``500``   、   ``1000``   、   ``2000``   、   ``4000``"
"   、   ``8000``   、   ``16000``    Hz。它继承    ``FmodAudioEffectEQ``    的全部属性和方法。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffecteq10.rst:25 5c5f9ce02c3f4d6d94e435c33d17fe39
msgid ""
"Each band can be individually adjusted for gain (-60 dB to +24 dB), frequency, Q value, and "
"filter type. By default, all bands use peaking filters with a Q value of 0.707."
msgstr "每个频段均可独立设置增益（-60 dB 到 +24 dB）、频率、Q 值和滤波类型。默认使用 Q 值为 0.707 的峰值滤波器。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffecteq10.rst:27 dc6fca11413548628b2c8cb1f86a4153
msgid ""
"The frequency bands are: 31Hz, 62Hz, 125Hz, 250Hz, 500Hz, 1000Hz, 2000Hz, 4000Hz, 8000Hz, and "
"16000Hz."
msgstr "频段中心频率依次为 31、62、125、250、500、1000、2000、4000、8000 和 16000 Hz。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffecteq10.rst:29 193b7a2b61654291936775402ed49348
msgid ""
"\\ **Note:** For simpler control, use :ref:`FmodAudioEffectEQ6<class_FmodAudioEffectEQ6>`. For "
"professional-grade equalization, use :ref:`FmodAudioEffectEQ21<class_FmodAudioEffectEQ21>`."
msgstr ""
"**注意：**    简单的均衡控制可使用    :ref:`FmodAudioEffectEQ6<class_FmodAudioEffectEQ6>`   ，更精细的均衡控制可使用    "
":ref:`FmodAudioEffectEQ21<class_FmodAudioEffectEQ21>`   。"

